    "name": "Re \u2013 Fracture: The Prophet\u2019s Awakening",
    "steam_appid": 3462180,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3462180/extras/10fcf1b05e7b406bf98a5f6f1ac92c6a.poster.avif?t=1742456297\" width=602 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3462180/extras/10fcf1b05e7b406bf98a5f6f1ac92c6a.webm?t=1742456297\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3462180/extras/10fcf1b05e7b406bf98a5f6f1ac92c6a.mp4?t=1742456297\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Re - Fracture : The Prophet's Awakening\u00a0</strong>is a <strong>Traversal themed RPG</strong> where momentum is your greatest weapon. As <strong>Shaiden Wreath</strong>, you will master <strong>Shadow-based abilities</strong>\u00a0allowing you to chain together aerial manoeuvres, teleport past obstacles, and uncover the truth behind the <strong>Collapse</strong>, and your missing brother, Siege.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A <strong>Traversal-Heavy RPG</strong> complemented by <strong>Dynamic Combat</strong> and a <strong>Robust Dialogue System</strong>, Re - Fracture offers players a high-speed, fluid movement system where every rooftop, ledge, and wall is part of the playground.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Leap between towering buildings, execute seamless teleports, and outmanoeuvre foes in a world built for movement.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3462180/extras/80d345b7117947fe370dca102e7c6545.poster.avif?t=1742456297\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3462180/extras/80d345b7117947fe370dca102e7c6545.webm?t=1742456297\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3462180/extras/80d345b7117947fe370dca102e7c6545.mp4?t=1742456297\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fluid Traversal System</strong> \u2013 Surge, blink, and warp effortlessly through an interconnected city, mastering movement-based abilities like <strong>Phantom Vault</strong> and <strong>Phantom Reach</strong> to navigate obstacles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fast-Paced Combat (In Development)</strong> \u2013 Strike with <strong>Shadow Slashes</strong>, phase through enemy attacks, and chain together warps for devastating finishers.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Engaging Story &amp; Dialogue</strong> \u2013 Unravel the mystery of <strong>Siege and the Collapse</strong> through dynamic dialogue and world interactions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Exploration &amp; Side Activities</strong> \u2013 Challenge yourself with <strong>Time Trial Races</strong>, test your skills in <strong>environmental puzzles</strong>, or dive into <strong>Drifta\u2019s underground rap scene</strong> in a unique rhythm-based mini-game.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Traverse the unknown, master the shadows, and <strong>define your own path</strong> in <strong>Project: Contrast</strong>.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3462180/extras/10fcf1b05e7b406bf98a5f6f1ac92c6a.poster.avif?t=1742456297\" width=602 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3462180/extras/10fcf1b05e7b406bf98a5f6f1ac92c6a.webm?t=1742456297\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3462180/extras/10fcf1b05e7b406bf98a5f6f1ac92c6a.mp4?t=1742456297\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Re - Fracture : The Prophet's Awakening\u00a0</strong>is a <strong>Traversal themed RPG</strong> where momentum is your greatest weapon. As <strong>Shaiden Wreath</strong>, you will master <strong>Shadow-based abilities</strong>\u00a0allowing you to chain together aerial manoeuvres, teleport past obstacles, and uncover the truth behind the <strong>Collapse</strong>, and your missing brother, Siege.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A <strong>Traversal-Heavy RPG</strong> complemented by <strong>Dynamic Combat</strong> and a <strong>Robust Dialogue System</strong>, Re - Fracture offers players a high-speed, fluid movement system where every rooftop, ledge, and wall is part of the playground.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Leap between towering buildings, execute seamless teleports, and outmanoeuvre foes in a world built for movement.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3462180/extras/80d345b7117947fe370dca102e7c6545.poster.avif?t=1742456297\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3462180/extras/80d345b7117947fe370dca102e7c6545.webm?t=1742456297\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3462180/extras/80d345b7117947fe370dca102e7c6545.mp4?t=1742456297\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fluid Traversal System</strong> \u2013 Surge, blink, and warp effortlessly through an interconnected city, mastering movement-based abilities like <strong>Phantom Vault</strong> and <strong>Phantom Reach</strong> to navigate obstacles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fast-Paced Combat (In Development)</strong> \u2013 Strike with <strong>Shadow Slashes</strong>, phase through enemy attacks, and chain together warps for devastating finishers.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Engaging Story &amp; Dialogue</strong> \u2013 Unravel the mystery of <strong>Siege and the Collapse</strong> through dynamic dialogue and world interactions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Exploration &amp; Side Activities</strong> \u2013 Challenge yourself with <strong>Time Trial Races</strong>, test your skills in <strong>environmental puzzles</strong>, or dive into <strong>Drifta\u2019s underground rap scene</strong> in a unique rhythm-based mini-game.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Traverse the unknown, master the shadows, and <strong>define your own path</strong> in <strong>Project: Contrast</strong>.</p>",
    "short_description": "Re \u2013 Fracture: The Prophet\u2019s Awakening follows the journey of Shaiden Wreath as he searches for his brother displaced by the tragic series of destructive events that led to the collapse of their world.",
